commit 6fcfdd53925cda6fac78ef784c11d9b0a8eef60d
Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Thu Sep 17 18:51:46 2026 +1000

    Convert the compute services to JSON logging.
    
    Nova, the Nova cell services, Ironic, Cyborg and Masakari now honour
    openstack_logging_json.
    
    Both Nova templates carry several debug settings, but only the one in
    [DEFAULT] is oslo.log's -- the others configure client library debug
    for Glance, Cinder and friends, and are left alone. Masakari has a
    second configuration file for its monitors, which logs through
    oslo.log as well and so is converted with it.
    
    Prompt: Michael asked for the bulk conversion to be broken into
    batches by project rather than landing as thirty separate commits.
    
    Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context, high effort) <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context, high effort) <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    Change-Id: Idcb690f157a8954eb79ebf758cf1418fb52cdcfd
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

